        253.35806274414062,
        368.7115478515625
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "To highlight the maneuverability (i.e., turning radius) advantages provided by post-stall ﬂight, we",
      "bbox": [
        88.19699096679688,
        377.46002197265625,
        518.7806396484375,
        386.2569885253906
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "explore the performance of aerial vehicles in a turn. To do this, we analyze a trim condition for a",
      "bbox": [
        88.19699096679688,
        389.416015625,
        518.7804565429688,
        398.2129821777344
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
